<title>ALGERIA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>ALGERIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970625)</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 27 Nov 95 for a five-</p>
<p>    year term)............Liamine ZEROUAL</p>
<p>(Also Defence Minister)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Prime Minister (Re-apptd 14 June 97).......Ahmed OUYAHIA</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>THREE-PARTY COALITION GOVERNMENT (Formed 25 Jun 97):</p>
<p>(Only names known so far)</p>
<p>Defence......See President</p>
<p>Energy &amp; Mining............Youssef YOUSFI</p>
<p>Finance...............Abdelkrim HARCHAOUI</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs...............Ahmed ATTAF</p>
<p>Interior..............Mustapha BENMANSOUR</p>
<p>Trade........Bakhti BELAIB</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>General Secretary of the Government.......Mahfoud LACHEB</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Head of the Presidential Office............Youcef YOUSFI</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor.Abdelwahab KERAMANE</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>	   government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>	   Editorial Reference Unit, London, on</p>
<p>	   (171) 542 7968.</p>
<p>		     (End government list)</p>
